        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our amended and restated memorandum and articles of association provide that we renounce, to the maximum extent permitted by law, our interest in any corporate opportunity offered to any director or officer, or about which any of our officers or directors acquires knowledge, unless such opportunity is expressly offered to such person solely in his or her capacity as a director or officer of our company and such opportunity is one we are legally and contractually permitted to undertake and would otherwise be reasonable for us to pursue.",
